  "notes": "{間違|まちが}う is an intransitive verb meaning to be wrong or make a mistake.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Related: ⟦{間違|まちが}える→間違える：01109_machigaeru⟧ (transitive, to mistake one thing for another)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{間違|まちが}う (take the wrong road)\n- ⟦{答|こた}え→答え：00790_kotae⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{間違|まちが}う (get the answer wrong)\n- {間違|まちが}っている (is wrong/incorrect)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{間違|まちが}い→間違い：03733_machigai⟧: mistake, error (noun)\n- ⟦{間違|まちが}いない→間違いない：17813_machigainai⟧: no mistake, definitely",
